  description: "Roll a six-sided die. Apply this effect, depending on whose turn
    it is.\r\n\u25CF During your turn: Banish cards from your GY equal to the result.
    Then, if the result was 1, send 6 cards from the top of your Deck to the GY.\r\n\u25CF
    During your opponent's turn: Send cards from the top of your Deck to the GY equal
    to the result. Then, if the result was 6, banish 1 card from your GY."
